Z||000000||V8Fiero||04-21-2001||10:57 PM||||Just wanting to spread my joy! I had my V8 out on the road today for the first time in a year and a half. Had to park it because I stripped the flywheel and lived in an apartment and no place to drop the engine. Well I finally.......FINALLY got all the bugs worked out....4 core radiator.......new springs/struts.......no leaks.......<P>it is purring like a kitten. Almost forgot how much fun this car is. Waiting on my 16" wheels to arrive..(thanks again Haze) and still need to put in new rear wheel bearings before alignment.<P>Then its back on the road...<P>All that then its to the body work.....<P>Sorry to rant...just sharing my joy of my fiero....<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Scott||||reg||14
