Z||000004||V8Fiero||04-23-2001||12:11 AM||||Hey Ross,<P>Well after really "looking" at my alignment on the wheel in question, I have decided to wait until I get my new 16" wheels on and my new rear wheel bearings installed before I head to the alignment shop. Did take it around the block today and punched it one time....WOW....almost forgot how much power is on tap.<P>ferrari momo.....I too am seeing a little warmer running with my 4 core. I did notice if I have the fan running most of the time it really keeps the temp down. This week Im going to fully make sure that I have all the air out of the system.<P>Scott||||reg||1
